OL,3,GNEWSA'Beatties redevelopment wait has
OL,4,Agone on far too long'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWolverhampton's council leader says the
OL,7,Fdelay in redeveloping the former
OL,8,FBeatties department store has gone on
OL,9,F"far too long", with the council now
OL,10,Fpursuing steps to bring the landmark
OL,11,Fbuilding back into use.
OL,13,FStephen Simkins was answering questions
OL,14,Ffrom listeners during BBC Radio WM's
OL,15,FHot Seat segment.
OL,17,FAs well as the future of Beatties, he
OL,18,Fdiscussed housing shortages, other
OL,19,Flong-derelict sites across the city and
OL,20,Fconcerns over Wolverhampton's taxi
OL,21,Flicensing system.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
